    "detailed_description": "Horror game.<br />\r\nThe player needs to get out of the maze with animatronics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe player has lives that are reduced when the animatron comes close, in order to scare him the player needs to scream use a key F on the keyboard.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe  scream has a cooldown, so you need to think carefully about when to  scream and when to run away.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has achievements and a leaderboard.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHave fun in the maze!",
